      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 1.752,
          "end": 5.587,
          "en": "This object form of describing the location",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.587,
          "end": 7.85,
          "en": "or the destination of a link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.85,
          "end": 9.84,
          "en": "can also be useful for other things,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.84,
          "end": 13.31,
          "en": "not just for using names and setting up a link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.31,
          "end": 15.796,
          "en": "in a more convenient way instead of building a long string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.796,
          "end": 18.484,
          "en": "But also to maybe add extra information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.484,
          "end": 19.687,
          "en": "which you might need.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.687,
          "end": 23.89,
          "en": "Let's say you want to use a query parameter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.89,
          "end": 25.55,
          "en": "In case you're not sure what that is,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.55,
          "end": 28.93,
          "en": "a query parameter is the thing you see in some routes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.93,
          "end": 32.04,
          "en": "and some URLs after the question mark.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.04,
          "end": 34.404,
          "en": "Like, sort equals ascending",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.404,
          "end": 37.44,
          "en": "A query parameter is basically an optional",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.44,
          "end": 40.99,
          "en": "route parameter which is not needed to find",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.99,
          "end": 43.386,
          "en": "and load a component, but which may be used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.386,
          "end": 47.191,
          "en": "to then pass extra information into that component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.191,
          "end": 49.666,
          "en": "It's not a must use but it can be useful",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.666,
          "end": 52.469,
          "en": "in some Apps and some pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.469,
          "end": 56.03,
          "en": "Now you could add such a query parameter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 56.03,
          "end": 58.57,
          "en": "If you build your link manually",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.57,
          "end": 61.66,
          "en": "by simply adding it to your string",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.66,
          "end": 64.127,
          "en": "which you're building, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 64.127,
          "end": 67.766,
          "en": "But if you use this object form, it's even more convenient.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 67.766,
          "end": 70.281,
          "en": "You can add a query property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 70.281,
          "end": 74.059,
          "en": "Next to name and parents to this config object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 74.059,
          "end": 78.651,
          "en": "and query then takes a nested object, just as parents did.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 78.651,
          "end": 81.65,
          "en": "And here you can add any query parameters",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 81.65,
          "end": 85.05,
          "en": "you might want to pass to the to be loaded page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 85.05,
          "end": 90.05,
          "en": "like sort with a value of asc a string saying asc.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 90.502,
          "end": 93.699,
          "en": "I'll reformat that to make it a bit easier to read.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 93.699,
          "end": 97.00999999999999,
          "en": "And you can add any query parameters you want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 97.00999999999999,
          "end": 100.041,
          "en": "and of course your page, your Component support.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 100.041,
          "end": 104.93,
          "en": "These query parameters are not defined in the route config,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 104.93,
          "end": 106.78999999999999,
          "en": "you don't need to add anything here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 106.78999999999999,
          "end": 109.86,
          "en": "because they're optional by nature.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 109.86,
          "end": 113.11,
          "en": "But now if I save that and reload.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 113.11,
          "end": 116.27000000000001,
          "en": "If I click View Members you see that query parameter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 116.27000000000001,
          "end": 119.72999999999999,
          "en": "is added to the URL automatically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 119.72999999999999,
          "end": 121.855,
          "en": "Now we're not doing anything with the parameter here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 121.855,
          "end": 123.682,
          "en": "but we are adding it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 123.682,
          "end": 127.81,
          "en": "And if you would want to use it in the component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 127.81,
          "end": 130.63,
          "en": "that is loaded through that query parameter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 130.63,
          "end": 133.679,
          "en": "So in this case, team members, you can extract it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 133.679,
          "end": 136.793,
          "en": "there you get access to your query parameters.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 137.7,
          "end": 142.173,
          "en": "If I console log it through this route dot query.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 143.4,
          "end": 145.94,
          "en": "The query property holds information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 145.94,
          "end": 147.88,
          "en": "about your query parameters.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 147.88,
          "end": 151.96,
          "en": "So if I save that and reload and open the console,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 151.96,
          "end": 153.63,
          "en": "we see we get an object here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 153.63,
          "end": 156.813,
          "en": "which has this sort key and the value of ascending.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 156.813,
          "end": 160.228,
          "en": "So that's is how you get access to the query parameters,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 160.228,
          "end": 164.203,
          "en": "you might be passing to a component through routing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 166.55,
          "end": 168.7,
          "en": "As a side note query parameters",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 168.7,
          "end": 170.7,
          "en": "are not provided as props.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 170.7,
          "end": 172.594,
          "en": "If I log this dot sort here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 172.594,
          "end": 174.95,
          "en": "hoping that you get a sword prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 174.95,
          "end": 177.548,
          "en": "Since we have a source query parameter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 177.548,
          "end": 179.1,
          "en": "You will see that the value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 179.1,
          "end": 182.076,
          "en": "I get here is actually undefined.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 182.076,
          "end": 185.03,
          "en": "It's undefined because query parameters",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 185.03,
          "end": 188.335,
          "en": "are just accessible through dollar sign route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 188.335,
          "end": 190.79,
          "en": "There shouldn't be a problem though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 190.79,
          "end": 194.06,
          "en": "because query parameters are optional anyways.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 194.06,
          "end": 197.921,
          "en": "So if you ever use your component in a different way,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 197.921,
          "end": 200.599,
          "en": "so not by routing but by embedding it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 200.599,
          "end": 202.532,
          "en": "in a number of components template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 202.532,
          "end": 205.365,
          "en": "You might simply not have access to the query parameter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 205.365,
          "end": 207.281,
          "en": "but since it is optional anyways,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 207.281,
          "end": 210.02,
          "en": "and it might not be added to the URL as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 211.52,
          "end": 213.93,
          "en": "Your code should be prepared to handle",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 213.93,
          "end": 217.899,
          "en": "the non existence of this query parameter anyways.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 217.899,
          "end": 221.13,
          "en": "But that's it for query parameters here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 221.13,
          "end": 223.61,
          "en": "I wanted to bring it up, because it is important",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 223.61,
          "end": 225.457,
          "en": "to be able to work with those as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 225.457,
          "end": 227.95,
          "en": "It is important to know that view router",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 227.95,
          "end": 229.94299999999998,
          "en": "makes adding and extracting them easy.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 229.94299999999998,
          "end": 233.648,
          "en": "We don't need them for this dummy application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 233.648,
          "end": 237.493,
          "en": "but you might need them for our applications of course.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
